{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19583","headline":"赋得冬日可爱 · 庾承宣","name":"赋得冬日可爱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雾开天霁，寒郊见初日。\n林疎照逾远，冰轻影微出。\n岂假阳和气，暂忘玄冬律。\n愁抱望自宽，羁情就如失。\n欣欣事几许，曈曈状非一。\n倾心倘知期，良愿自兹毕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾承宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}